# The other screens: Achievements, Leaderboards (a guest sees this device's
# boards), Settings (the game's palette and assists, the runtime's Options
# for the rest) and Help with the bound keys; the Daily Breeze setup and a
# round paused in its countdown, Settings and Help from the pause screen, and
# Leave round to the ranked results; Escape backs out of screens.
until 300 Play
frames 60
click Achievements
until 60 First Clearing
expect Finish all five lessons.
frames 10
save achievements
click Back
until 60 Play
frames 10
click Leaderboards
until 60 Offline — showing this device's scores.
frames 10
click This device
until 60 Scores from this device.
expect No scores yet — be the first breeze.
frames 10
save boards
key Escape 2
until 60 Play
frames 10
click Settings
until 60 Color palette
expect Predicted flight arc (timing assist)
expect Open Options
frames 10
save settings
click Left-handed layout
frames 10
click Back
until 60 Play
frames 10
key KeyH 2
until 60 How to play
expect Space
frames 10
click Back
until 60 Play
frames 10
click Daily Breeze
until 60 One shared sky for everyone today.
expect survive 90s
expect Yes — shared seed, replay-verified
frames 10
save daily-setup
click Start
frames 30
key Escape 2
until 30 Paused
frames 10
click Settings
until 60 Color palette
frames 10
click Back
until 60 Paused
frames 10
click Help
until 60 How to play
frames 10
key Escape 2
until 60 Paused
frames 10
click Leave round
until 60 You headed home early.
expect Ranked round — replay recorded for verification.
frames 10
save daily-results
click Menu
until 60 Play
